{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25950","headline":"秋怀五首 三 · 鲍溶","name":"秋怀五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九月夜如年，幽房劳别梦。\n不知别日远，夜夜犹相送。\n玉牀暗虫响，锦席寒泪冻。\n明镜失旧人，空林误归凤。\n新年堪爱惜，锦字亦珍重。\n一念皎皎时，幽襟非所用。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}